{"name":"Black Tortoise","hex":"#353235","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Black Tortoise","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["Synonym of Black Turtle."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Black_Tortoise"}],"entries":[{"title":"Black Turtle-Snake","blocks":[{"text":"The Black Turtle-Snake is one of the Four Symbols of the Chinese constellations. It is usually depicted as a tortoise or turtle, intertwined with a snake."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/79/Wadang-xuanwu.jpg/330px-Wadang-xuanwu.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Black_Turtle-Snake"},{"title":"Tortoise","blocks":[{"text":"Tortoises are reptiles of the family Testudinidae of the order Testudines. Like other testudines, tortoises have a shell to protect from predation and other threats. The shell in tortoises is generally hard, and like other members of the suborder Cryptodira, they retract their necks and heads directly backward into the shell to protect them."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/aa/A._gigantea_Aldabra_Giant_Tortoise.jpg/330px-A._gigantea_Aldabra_Giant_Tortoise.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tortoise"},{"title":"Black","blocks":[{"text":"Black is a color that results from the absence or complete absorption of visible light. It is an achromatic color, without chroma, like white and grey. It is often used symbolically or figuratively to represent darkness. Black and white have often been used to describe opposites such as good and evil, the Dark Ages versus the Age of Enlightenment, and night versus day. Since the Middle Ages, black has been the symbolic color of solemnity and authority, and for this reason it is still commonly worn by judges and magistrates."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fc/Tutankhamun_jackal_%28blacked%29.png/330px-Tutankhamun_jackal_%28blacked%29.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Black"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1e/Wudanghshan-Xuanwu-in-Beijing-Capital-Museum-3796.jpg/330px-Wudanghshan-Xuanwu-in-Beijing-Capital-Museum-3796.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1e/Wudanghshan-Xuanwu-in-Beijing-Capital-Museum-3796.jpg/330px-Wudanghshan-Xuanwu-in-Beijing-Capital-Museum-3796.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AWudanghshan-Xuanwu-in-Beijing-Capital-Museum-3796.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d4/Southern_Dynasties_Brick_Relief_11.jpg/500px-Southern_Dynasties_Brick_Relief_11.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d4/Southern_Dynasties_Brick_Relief_11.jpg/1280px-Southern_Dynasties_Brick_Relief_11.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d4/Southern_Dynasties_Brick_Relief_11.jpg/500px-Southern_Dynasties_Brick_Relief_11.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Black Tortoise with Snake. Southern Dynasties Brick Relief 11.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ASouthern_Dynasties_Brick_Relief_11.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e5/Yangzhou_-_Zhenwu_Hall_-_tortoise_-_P1070195.JPG/500px-Yangzhou_-_Zhenwu_Hall_-_tortoise_-_P1070195.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e5/Yangzhou_-_Zhenwu_Hall_-_tortoise_-_P1070195.JPG/1280px-Ya